rId":"uid_1773834098439_arzdfz2m7","key":"markers","value":{}},{"userId":"uid_1773834098439_arzdfz2m7","key":"monthly_2026-01","value":{"text":"我是于季。一月悄然走过，我翻看你的记录，发现这是一个全然“留白”的月份。\n\n没有冗长的日程把你困在原地，也没有繁杂的待办催促你向前。看着你以“平静”的心情“平稳度过”这段时光，我由衷地替你感到开心。生活本就不需要时刻被填满，偶尔停下脚步，享受什么都不做的从容，反而是最难得的奢侈。\n\n接下来的日子，无论你是想继续安然休憩，还是准备重新出发，我都会在这里，静静地陪着你。","characterId":"c3c930c9-d401-4f34-9bc1-b597a4765bb1","characterName":"于季","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2064%2064%22%3E%3Crect%20width%3D%2264%22%20height%3D%2264%22%20rx%3D%2232%22%20fill%3D%22%23BBDEFB%22%2F%3E%3Ctext%20x%3D%2232%22%20y%3D%2242%22%20font-size%3D%2232%22%20font-family%3D%22-apple-system%2CBlinkMacSystemFont%2C'PingFang%20SC'%2C'Microsoft%20YaHei'%2Csans-serif%22%20font-weight%3D%22600%22%20text-anchor%3D%22middle%22%20fill%3D%22%230D47A1%22%3E%E4%BA%8E%3C%2Ftext%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E","generatedAt":1776423140093}},{"userId":"uid_1773834098439_arzdfz2m7","key":"moods","value":{}},{"userId":"uid_1773834098439_arzdfz2m7","key":"todos","value":[]},{"userId":"uid_1780041147963_5o9r64zqw","key":"customHolidays","value":{}},{"userId":"uid_1780041147963_5o9r64zqw","key":"enabledCountries","value":["CN"]},{"userId":"uid_1780041147963_5o9r64zqw","key":"events","value":[]},{"userId":"uid_1780041147963_5o9r64zqw","key":"markers","value":{}},{"userId":"uid_1780041147963_5o9r64zqw","key":"moods","value":{}},{"userId":"uid_1780041147963_5o9r64zqw","key":"todos","value":[]},{"userId":"uid_1781025795527_2a8qs5xe7","key":"customHolidays","value":{}},{"userId":"uid_1781025795527_2a8qs5xe7","key":"enabledCountries","value":["CN"]},{"userId":"uid_1781025795527_2a8qs5xe7","key":"events","value":[]},{"userId":"uid_1781025795527_2a8qs5xe7","key":"markers","value":{}},{"userId":"uid_1781025795527_2a8qs5xe7","key":"moods","value":{}},{"userId":"uid_1781025795527_2a8qs5xe7","key":"todos","value":[]}]